      en: ["First mentioned in 1253 in the records of the Livonian Order.", "Lake Puzes covers 5.2 square kilometers and is 33 meters deep.", "The Puze Lutheran Church was built in the year 1776.", "The estate was the seat of the influential von Behr dynasty.", "The parish territory includes several protected forest zones.", "Located in the northern part of the Courland Peninsula."],
